Subject: [PATCH] feat(gflowx): scene tag to model resolution before relay

Add gflowxscene package mapping API scene labels to concrete model names
with env overrides (GFLOWX_SCENE_*), wire into Relay after request parse.
Includes unit tests; disable via GFLOWX_SCENES_ENABLED=false.
